      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZOUS APOLLO (6) resumes. Chased gamely into fourth when last sighted here over 1200m back on Jan 23. Holds genuine claims fresh. MUSUMECI (2) is backing up four days after he was safely held at Grafton against better opposition. Can atone. BON BATAN (1) ran a better race last start to finish a close second when second-up over 1200m at Inverell. Nicely placed to maintain the form. THE MICHAEL (4) returns and strips fitter for a quiet trial here. Doesn't find a deep maiden, so is one to keep in mind. VOYSEY (5) didn't fire a shot on debut at Grafton before heading straight back to the paddock. Should find this easier but needs to have improved.",
